    "readme_top_lines": [
      "# mcproof",
      "`mcproof` is the verification harness and Plane 1 rulebook for the Siliconcordat Formal Verification MDE. It checks Lean 4.35.0 proofs across six kernels, tests Python exact-math checkers against planted bugs, and verifies honest claim labels. Proof authors, automated verifiers, and local open-weight compilers use it to catch vacuous theorems, float drift, and overstated claims.",
      "Blueprint and acceptance gates live in [siliconcordat/mde issue 4](https://github.com/siliconcordat/mde/issues/4) under the [Siliconcordat Master Plan](https://github.com/siliconcordat/.github/blob/main/MASTER-PLAN.md)."
    ],
